---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6 py-24 md:py-32 min-h-[70vh]">
  <img
    src={`${base}/profil.jpg`}
    alt="Photo de Valentin Malindi"
    width="160"
    height="160"
    class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-full object-cover ring-4 ring-emerald-400/70 ring-offset-4 ring-offset-gray-950 shadow-xl shadow-emerald-500/20 mb-8 animate-fade-up"
  />
  <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6 animate-fade-up" style="--delay: 100ms">
    Salut, je suis <span class="text-emerald-400">Valentin Malindi</span> <span class="animate-wave">👋</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-400 mb-10 animate-fade-up" style="--delay: 250ms">
    Titulaire d’un BUT Informatique et étudiant en cycle ingénieur à l’ESEO Dijon,
    je recherche une <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">alternance de 3 ans</span>.
  </p>
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 animate-fade-up" style="--delay: 400ms">
    <a href="#alternance" class="bg-emerald-500 text-gray-900 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-emerald-400 transition">
      Ma recherche d’alternance
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}/cv`} class="border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:border-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition">
      Voir mon CV
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
